EARLIER VERSIONS OF THIS REPOSITORY

Commits up to VRCT-VOX 0.1.0 also contain

    src-python/models/ocr/onnx/chatbox_yolox_tiny.onnx

which is VRCT's VRChat chat-bubble detection model. The MIT License above
does not apply to that file. It is licensed under the VRCT Chat-Bubble
Detection Model License Agreement, whose text is in the same folder of
those commits (LICENSE.txt, Japanese and authoritative; LICENSE.en.txt,
English) and in upstream VRCT. VRCT-VOX never shipped or ran it, and
removed it from the repository in 0.2.0.

    Copyright (c) 2026 misyaguziya. All rights reserved.

See NOTICE.md for details and for the third-party components and licenses
in VRCT-VOX builds.
